# Summary

Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws [[cite:obs-8363e79d7e2e124403dd6033d2caa210dc622d98 "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]].

The loan table specifies that novels may be borrowed for twenty-one days and this period is renewable twice [[cite:obs-ce8f7257aaa4a26f139b615777de5a0fe3b3e386 "Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice."]].
